the goal has been the same.

20
00:01:43,500 --> 00:01:46,540
Make lighter, more durable, and smarter guns

21
00:01:46,541 --> 00:01:50,160
that can fire faster, farther, and with more accuracy.

22
00:01:50,161 --> 00:02:04,161
Ironically, in the next century, the goal will also be to make some guns less deadly.

23
00:02:04,360 --> 00:02:09,660
But creating the guns of the future will go beyond making improvements to just the machinery

24
00:02:09,661 --> 00:02:10,660
