25
00:02:10,661 --> 00:02:16,500
Looking at future weapons systems is to start moving your eyes from simply pipes with rifling

26
00:02:16,501 --> 00:02:22,900
in them to systems that work together to accomplish the mission.

27
00:02:22,901 --> 00:02:28,280
Right now we think of a rifle alone as a weapon system, and that's the gun.

28
00:02:28,281 --> 00:02:32,080
But what we're beginning to do by putting electronics on the gun, putting electronics

29
00:02:32,081 --> 00:02:38,700
on the soldier, and having the multiple soldiers being able to link together is then making

30
00:02:38,701 --> 00:02:44,820
the entire element a weapon system.

31
00:02:44,821 --> 00:02:47,220
The idea is simple.

32
00:02:47,221 --> 00:02:52,360
Take what works and make it work in a changing world driven by the advanced technology of

33
00:02:52,361 --> 00:02:56,360
computers.

34
00:02:56,361 --> 00:03:02,160
However, implementing that idea is not an easy task, given that the basic components

35
00:03:02,161 --> 00:03:08,060
