59
00:05:18,300 --> 00:05:22,680
One such weapon developed in the 1960s was called the gyrojet.

60
00:05:23,240 --> 00:05:26,720
It was not so much a gun as it was a small rocket launcher.

61
00:05:28,080 --> 00:05:33,700
The way it works is the cartridges themselves are loaded into the gun, into the magazine.

62
00:05:34,260 --> 00:05:37,600
The hammer is actually forward of the cartridge.

63
00:05:38,240 --> 00:05:41,120
And what happens is that when you pull the trigger,

64
00:05:41,220 --> 00:05:46,740
the hammer pushes the little rocket back onto a fixed firing pin.

65
00:05:47,240 --> 00:05:50,600
This ignites the charge, and this thing takes off.

66
00:05:52,300 --> 00:05:55,020
The gyrojet had two major drawbacks.

67
00:05:55,400 --> 00:05:58,760
It was not very powerful, and it was wildly inaccurate.

68
00:06:00,960 --> 00:06:03,040
We're not going to be able to fire this here today

69
00:06:03,041 --> 00:06:05,760
